    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" SimulatedClock : composition – creates the clock
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" RideService : composition – builds every service
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" CaptainService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" CustomerService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" FareService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" MatchingService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" PaymentService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" EarningsService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "1" RatingService : composition
    ChennaiRideApp "1" *-- "2" Notifier : composition – one SMS and one push notifier

    RideService o-- FareService : aggregation – injected, shared
    RideService o-- MatchingService : aggregation – injected, shared
    RideService o-- PaymentService : aggregation – injected, shared
    RideService "1" o-- "0..*" Notifier : aggregation – list of Notifier (polymorphism)
    RideService --> SimulatedClock : association – all time comes from here
    RideService --> ServiceArea : association – validates pickup and drop
    RideService "1" --> "0..*" Ride : association – creates and tracks rides
    MatchingService o-- CaptainService : aggregation – injected
    MatchingService o-- FareService : aggregation – ETA maths
    PaymentService o-- EarningsService : aggregation – injected
    PaymentService "1" *-- "0..*" PaymentRecord : composition – the ledger
    EarningsService "1" *-- "0..*" DailyEarnings : composition – one per captain per day
    DailyEarnings "0..*" --> "1" Captain : association
    FareService "1" *-- "4" Vehicle : composition – rate-card vehicles
    FareService ..> FareEstimate : dependency – creates
    FareService ..> FareReceipt : dependency – creates
    CaptainService "1" o-- "0..*" Captain : aggregation – registry
    CustomerService "1" o-- "0..*" Customer : aggregation – registry
    CaptainService --> SimulatedClock : association
    CustomerService --> SimulatedClock : association
    RatingService ..> Ride : dependency – rates completed rides
    PaymentService ..> Payable : dependency – calls pay(), dynamic dispatch

    Notifier <|-- SmsNotifier : inheritance – overrides notify()
    Notifier <|-- PushNotifier : inheritance – overrides notify()

    note for RideService "book_ride(... passengers=1, payment_method=None, coupon_code=None):<br>Python has no method overloading, so default/keyword args are used."
    note for ChennaiRideApp "Composition root: builds the whole world.<br>The scripted demo AND the CLI (CliSession) use it."

